sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over C,VS: Document Ingestion Flow
        participant KA as Knowledge API
        participant PL as Pipeline
        participant CH as Chunker
        participant EM as Embedder
        participant VS as Vector Store

        C->>KA: POST /internal/knowledge/ingest
        KA->>KA: Validate content and collection
        KA->>PL: Ingest(document)
        PL->>CH: Chunk(content, size=1000, overlap=200)
        CH-->>PL: Text chunks[]
        loop Each chunk
            PL->>EM: Embed(chunk)
            EM-->>PL: Vector embedding
        end
        PL->>VS: Upsert(collection, vectors)
        VS-->>PL: Stored
        PL-->>KA: IngestResult(id, collection, chunk_count)
        KA-->>C: 200 OK with result
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over C,VS: Retrieval Query Flow
        C->>KA: POST /internal/knowledge/query
        KA->>KA: Validate query
        KA->>PL: Query(text, collection, top_k=5)
        PL->>EM: Embed(query_text)
        EM-->>PL: Query vector
        PL->>VS: Search(collection, vector, top_k)
        VS-->>PL: Ranked results[]
        PL-->>KA: QueryResult(chunks with scores)
        KA-->>C: 200 OK with results
    end
